your event details, we\u2019ll schedule a 45-minute meeting to discuss making your event a reality!<\/p>\n\n\n<style>.wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading1195_4a5273-6d, .wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading1195_4a5273-6d[data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading1195_4a5273-6d\"]{font-size:var(--global-kb-font-size-md, 1.25rem);font-style:normal;}.wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading1195_4a5273-6d mark.kt-highlight, .wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading1195_4a5273-6d[data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading1195_4a5273-6d\"] mark.kt-highlight{font-style:normal;color:#f76a0c;-webkit-box-decoration-break:clone;box-decoration-break:clone;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;}.wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading1195_4a5273-6d img.kb-inline-image, .wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading1195_4a5273-6d[data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading1195_4a5273-6d\"] img.kb-inline-image{width:150px;vertical-align:baseline;}<\/style>\n<p class=\"kt-adv-heading1195_4a5273-6d wp-block-kadence-advancedheading has-ast-global-color-2-color has-text-color\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading1195_4a5273-6d\">3. <em>Proposal:<\/em>&nbsp;A few days after our meeting, you\u2019ll receive a proposal that outlines our event services, a proposed timeline and estimated budget. Once the proposal is agreed upon, we will send a contract and invoice for your deposit.<\/p>\n\n\n<style>.wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading1195_7808e3-50, .wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading1195_7808e3-50[data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading1195_7808e3-50\"]{font-size:var(--global-kb-font-size-md, 1.25rem);font-style:normal;}.wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading1195_7808e3-50 mark.kt-highlight, .wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading1195_7808e3-50[data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading1195_7808e3-50\"] mark.kt-highlight{font-style:normal;color:#f76a0c;-webkit-box-decoration-break:clone;box-decoration-break:clone;padding-top:0px;p